Description:
devil (😈) is a library used by the Chromium developers to interact with Android
devices. It currently supports SDK level 16 and above.

Local Modifications:
Copied devil/ and removed tests. Populated via:
 - cp -r $CATAPULT_CHECKOUT/devil/devil/* devil/
 - find . -name "*test.py" -exec rm {} \;
